 "conventions": {
  "ppu": 64,
  "vehicles": "characters{} kind \"vehicle\" in the assets/vehicles conventions (dirs SE, NE; SW <- SE and NW <- NE with flipX; frame names {anim}_{dir}_{i}; no baked shadow: draw shadow[dir]; seats + over_* overlays; px points per dir, negate dx when mirrored). gb_van = the delivery_van_red rig exactly; gb_van_turn = its S / E / N corner frames (W <- E).",
  "patches": "A patch frame is drawn over its base frame at the same position with its own anchor / frameSize (the trimmed frame holds only the changed pixels). gb_van door / unload: over idle_<dir>_0 at body depth + patchDepth (0.0005), i.e. UNDER the seated / standing riders, and the van overlay switches to anims.<anim>.overlay (over_door_* / over_unload_*, same anchor / frameSize as the patch) - never draw a van patch above the riders or above over_*; door empties seat 0. gb_locker_* open over <key>_0; gb_banner_* (0.0012), gb_emblem_* / gb_roofparcel (0.0004) over logistics_center_shell, fading with the shell.",
  "mirror": "Phaser flips a frame about its CENTRE, not its anchor: a point (dx, dy) of a flipped sprite lands at (-dx + mirrorShiftPx, dy), mirrorShiftPx = frameW - 2 * anchorX * frameW (gb_van -2, gb_van_turn -4.0, gb_pennant -20.0, dog_sled 30.0). The red-van tables keep the plain negation (2 px); sledPennant ships explicit SW / NW tables because the sled and the pennant shift by 50 px between them.",
  "layers": "gb_nameplate_<lang> / seori_nameplate_<lang> share logistics_center frameSize + anchor: draw one of them INSTEAD of logistics_center_nameplate_<lang> (replaces), depth = building + 0.0005, alpha = shell alpha.",
  "states": "props / items with states{}: show the named frame (day / lit at night) - not an animation. litPatch: true -> the lit frame is a PATCH: draw it over the day frame at night.",
  "items": "72 x 72, anchor (36, 54); stackStep, carryScale, topPx, sizeClass from the matching cardboard_box_* (boxOf). Also usable as icons.",
  "text": "Letters only on: gb_roofsign_ko_0, gb_roofsign_ko_1, gb_roofsign_en_0, gb_roofsign_en_1, gb_nameplate_ko, gb_nameplate_en, seori_nameplate_ko, seori_nameplate_en, gb_banner_ko. No letters on any mirrored sprite (gb_van, gb_van_turn, gb_pennant).",
  "night": "Lit frames (_1 / roof sign _1) are drawn under the game's MULTIPLY night tint; add the usual ADD glow at the VISIBLE lightPoints (lightsVisible) / roofSignPoint / the sign disc for the lantern feel, and a soft ADD glow at logistics_center fxPoints.board so the 금방 nameplate and banner do not sink below the lit windows at night."
