   "turn": "gb_van_turn",
   "notes": "금방 van: the delivery_van_red rig (same frame, anchor, dirs, sizes and every point) in the 금방 livery - honey-gold body, navy belt line, cream roof band + snow, the symmetric 금방이 mark on both flanks, NO letters (SW / NW are flipX mirrors). The word 금방 rides on the camera-facing roof sign (roofSign / roofSignPoint). door (3 f, once): the driver door swings open; unload (4 f, once): the rear doors open, f3 shows the parcels at parcelPoints (parcelGround = the floor under them) - only where parcelPointsVisible says so: in SE / SW the rear faces away and the parcels are hidden by the body, so stage doorstep kerb stops facing NE / NW (doorstepDirs) or show the parcel only once it is in the courier's hands. door / unload are PATCHES: hold the body on idle_<dir>_0 and draw the patch frame at the SAME position with anims.<anim>.anchor / frameSize (the grown canvas; rects = [x, y, w, h] px from the van anchor) at body depth + patchDepth (0.0005: UNDER the riders), then the riders, then anims.<anim>.overlay (over_door_<dir>_<i> / over_unload_<dir>_<i>, same anchor / frameSize as the patch) INSTEAD of over_idle_<dir>_0. door: seat 0 (the driver) is empty while it plays - he steps out at doorPoints[0]; a seat-1 passenger stays and is drawn after the patch. Play backward to close. lightsVisible / tailsVisible: add night glows only at the visible lamps."
  },
